00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.840
protagonist
of the series so i was kind of

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:48.000
challenged on it in some ways
but there is a such thing as a human

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.119
experience
right and once you're able to find that

00:01:51.119 --> 00:01:54.399
human experience
um everybody's dealing with the same

00:01:54.399 --> 00:01:57.680
things we're all dealing with loss we're
all dealing with grief we're all dealing

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.520
