we're all dealing with it in varying

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.280
ways and so the difference between
something being

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:12.560
inauthentic and um
not well purposed which that happens

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:16.000
where people try to
tell a story that they're not doing it

